{"title": "For the Lord of Bones!", "pageid": 23189, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/For_the_Lord_of_Bones!", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Necrotic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp/300px-Generic_Necrotic.webp, /w/images/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp/300px-Generic_Necrotic.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>For the Lord of Bones!</b> is an action used by <a href=\"/wiki/Necromite\" title=\"Necromite\">Necromites</a>. This ability sacrifices the Necromite to the <a href=\"/wiki/Apostle_of_Myrkul\" title=\"Apostle of Myrkul\">Apostle of Myrkul</a>, granting him one use of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finger_of_Death\" title=\"Finger of Death\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Finger of Death\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Finger_of_Death\" title=\"Finger of Death\">Finger of Death</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nGrants the Apostle <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reaper%27s_Reward_(Condition)\" title=\"Reaper's Reward (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reaper's Reward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reaper%27s_Reward_(Condition)\" title=\"Reaper's Reward (Condition)\">Reaper's Reward</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\